## DM Time Tracking

Use this section to run two parties simultaneously on the same timeline.

**Master Clock:** Track a single elapsed time in minutes from the moment the floor is entered (or from when the first party enters, if they enter at different times).

**Individual Action Log (suggested format):**

| Minute | Party | Action | Time Cost | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 0 | Both | Floor entry | — | |
| 0–10 | A | Obelisk — look at Area 2 | 10 min | Reveals patrol pattern |
| 5 | B | Walk to Area 1 | 5 min | First visit |
| 10 | A | Walk to Area 2 | 5 min | First visit |
| 10 | B | Area 1 check begins | Roll 1d6 for time | |

**Trap Cycle Triggers:**
- Minute 30 — MOONFALL (2 random areas, 3 minutes, 1d4 piercing + Con DC 12)
- Minute 60 — PATROL SURGE (+1 Scout per area, 20 minutes)
- Minute 90 — SILVER FOG (obelisk +5 minutes, Perception −2 in center, 10 minutes)
- Minute 120 — Cycle resets

**Alert Propagation:**
- Loud failure or combat: target area +1 alert, adjacent areas +1 alert
- Alert drops 1 step per 15 minutes of quiet
- Guards do not enter the center courtyard under any circumstances

**Two-Party Interaction Notes:**
- Party A fight in Area 2 → Area 3 stealth DCs +2 for 10 minutes (guards drift toward noise)
- Party A occupying guards in Area 5 → Area 5's Warden is distracted; if Party B enters Area 5 within 5 minutes, reduce entrance Warden's Passive Perception by 3
- Both parties in center simultaneously → no mechanical effect; social/roleplay moment, handle as appropriate

